From 592020e32bf52bb273d2a6511108406b6d376d9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 15:16:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 14/25] Android: auto-map the built-in controller on launch

The launcher detects the first physical gamepad and applies a standard
template to GameCube pad 1 and GBA pads 2/3 (never overwriting an
existing non-touchscreen mapping), persisting exactly like the mapping
UI. A checklist row shows the result with a jump into input settings.
